{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117611","id":3418698479,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7LxTLv","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117611","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117611.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117611.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117611","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117611/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117611/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117611/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/93f0049508c628c5063de30f56aaac446f89b01d","number":117611,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix SkeletonModification2DJiggle `look_at` under mirrored transforms","user":{"login":"Kalcy-U","id":92387771,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYG5uw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92387771?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kalcy-U","html_url":"https://github.com/Kalcy-U","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kalcy-U/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kalcy-U/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kalcy-U/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kalcy-U/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kalcy-U/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kalcy-U/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kalcy-U/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kalcy-U/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kalcy-U/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\r\n- Fix incorrect jiggle bone orientation when parent Node2D is mirrored.\r\n- Add `reset_jiggle()` to allow resetting jiggle cache after abrupt changes (mirror flip/teleport), without affecting default behavior.\r\n\r\n## Issue\r\nFixes #117610\r\n\r\n## Reproduction\r\n1. Create a 2D character with Skeleton2D/Bone2D and add a SkeletonModification2DJiggle.\r\n2. Mirror the character by setting a parent Node2D scale to (-1, 1).\r\n3. Observe jiggle bones: before fix they keep pointing toward the pre-mirror direction.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n- Use node-based look_at\r\n- add reset_jiggle\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n[test2dskeleton.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26108514/test2dskeleton.zip)\r\n\r\n- Manual: scale (1, 1), (-1, 1), (-1, -1), (-1, 2), (0.2,1.0)\r\n- Manual: skew transform\r\n- All cases behave as expected.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"htt